    faqQ1: "Can I switch plans later?";
    faqA1: "Yes. You can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time. When upgrading, you get immediate access to new features. When downgrading, changes apply at the next billing cycle.";
    faqQ2: "Is there a free trial?";
    faqA2: "Yes. All plans come with a 14-day free trial. No credit card required. You can explore all Pro features during the trial period.";
    faqQ3: "What payment methods do you accept?";
    faqA3: "We accept bank transfers and credit cards. For annual plans, we offer a discount equivalent to 2 months free.";
    faqQ4: "Can I add more users or storage?";
    faqA4: "Yes. You can purchase additional users and storage as add-ons on any plan. Contact our sales team for custom pricing.";
    faqQ5: "Is my data secure?";
