    value4: "Scalability";
    value4Desc: "From a single garage to multi-branch enterprises";
    techTitle: "Technology";
    techBody: "TOLOM is built on modern stack: Next.js, Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage), and Vercel. Data is isolated per-organization via RLS policies and encrypted in transit (TLS) and at rest.";
